{"id":"31e71a3e39e9a1b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md","title":"Radon-Nikodym Theorem","display":"df-radon-nikodym — Radon-Nikodym Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-radon-nikodym","aliases":["58-df-radon-nikodym","Radon-Nikodym Theorem"],"display":"df-radon-nikodym — Radon-Nikodym Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[58-df-integral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-radon-nikodym"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-radon-nikodym</span><span>Radon-Nikodym Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-radon-nikodym — Radon-Nikodym Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\nu,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\nu,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_+\">\\(\\mathcal B_+\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]\">\\([0,\\infty]\\)</span> 上的 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>（本文件定义的 Radon–Nikodym 导数关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}radon\\text{-}nikodym} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\nf\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A f\\,d\\mu)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}radon\\text{-}nikodym} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\nf\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A f\\,d\\mu)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>载体与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数是导数关系的显式参数；同一对测度符号放在不同可测空间上不能共用一个三元谓词。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\nu\">\\(\\mu,\\nu\\)</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\ll\\mu\">\\(\\nu\\ll\\mu\\)</span>，则这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 存在并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-几乎处处意义下唯一，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\nu/d\\mu\">\\(d\\nu/d\\mu\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\ll\\nu\\ll\\mu\">\\(\\rho\\ll\\nu\\ll\\mu\\)</span> 且相应导数存在，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\rho/d\\mu=(d\\rho/d\\nu)(d\\nu/d\\mu)\">\\(d\\rho/d\\mu=(d\\rho/d\\nu)(d\\nu/d\\mu)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-几乎处处成立。</li>\n<li>Change of measure: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}^\\nu[f] = \\mathbb{E}^\\mu[f \\cdot d\\nu/d\\mu]\">\\(\\mathbb{E}^\\nu[f] = \\mathbb{E}^\\mu[f \\cdot d\\nu/d\\mu]\\)</span></li>\n<li>Absolutely continuous: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(A) = 0 \\Rightarrow \\nu(A) = 0\">\\(\\mu(A) = 0 \\Rightarrow \\nu(A) = 0\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Billingsley, Probability and Measure</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)$（see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_+$ 为 $[0,\\infty]$ 上的 Borel $\\sigma$-代数，且 $\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))$（see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\nu,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_+","display":false},{"tex":"[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}radon\\text{-}nikodym} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\nf\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A f\\,d\\mu)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\ll\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"d\\nu/d\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\ll\\nu\\ll\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"d\\rho/d\\mu=(d\\rho/d\\nu)(d\\nu/d\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}^\\nu[f] = \\mathbb{E}^\\mu[f \\cdot d\\nu/d\\mu]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(A) = 0 \\Rightarrow \\nu(A) = 0","display":false}],"bytes":1885,"backlinks":[{"id":"d41695b9af12c800","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\mu,\\nu;X,\\mathcal A)$ means that $f=d\\mu/d\\nu$ (see [[58-df-radon-nikodym]])"},{"id":"e26386e2f0e62d60","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (Radon–Nikodym 导数关系, see [[58-df-radon-nikodym]])"},{"id":"98b9feb035179dfc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RNDerivative}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"3976a06c4bfa0dd4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1030","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-radon-nikodym.md|58-df-radon-nikodym]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","bbbec05fde1d3b01","4884f45058a56aac"]}